  "citation": "Koertzinger A; Mintrop L; Duinker J C (1999): International Intercomparison Exercise of Underway fCO2 Systems During the R/V Meteor Cruise 36/1 in the North Atlantic Ocean. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP067",
